---
// Capas de luz + grano que siguen al cursor. El padre necesita:
// `data-spotlight group relative isolate overflow-hidden` (y opcionalmente `bg-noise` para el grano base).
---

<div
  class="spotlight-light pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100"
  aria-hidden="true"
></div>
<div
  class="spotlight-grain bg-grain pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100"
  aria-hidden="true"
></div>
